<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/6a9db53abc883051.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/3b2de044b5c960c6.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-e9294003587b8c5f.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-2135e4d8b8354323.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/31255-3edd74d97464922d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-4a28e43877adf86a.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/72473-c860f53c0c51e724.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/78199-b8f4a3996c9dc1ab.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/page-d855e89dc0e39e1b.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3a91511d-8f98e4ad93b8a8d6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/52249-331fcdd384af7e58.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/93658-618a9399c5e663bd.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/43077-827b3e680ae8ffe7.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/18720-04df30c6d2088552.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/9084-50a5161d529a4078.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/84292-2e31587b162b1d0c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/17570-a56365e85394c4ca.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/90700-0a71ee3d3421123d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/13308-3863d43c1023d15d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-5e54b197a4a06324.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/not-found-2665c95a363183b3.js" async=""></script><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/pyodide/v0.28.3/full/pyodide.js" async=""></script><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#050505"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"/><script id="normalize-browser-locale">
(() => {
  const raw = navigator.language || "en-US";
  try {
    new Intl.NumberFormat(raw);
    return;
  } catch {}
  const normalized = raw.split("@")[0].replace(/_/g, "-") || "en-US";
  let safe = normalized;
  try {
    new Intl.NumberFormat(safe);
  } catch {
    safe = "en-US";
  }
  try {
    Object.defineProperty(navigator, "language", {
      configurable: true,
      get: () => safe,
    });
  } catch {}
})();
</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__variable_246ccd __variable_c29908"><div hidden=""><!--$?--><template id="B:0"></template><!--/$--></div><section aria-label="Notifications alt+T" tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text" aria-atomic="false"></section><div class="page_page__ZU32B"><div class="page_firstScreen__mdWCR"><a class="page_banner__UN_1L" href="/hyperliquid"><span class="page_bannerTag__djT7D">New</span>Native Hyperliquid &amp; Jupiter perps, with on-chain TP / SL<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><header class="page_header__kVzhN"><a class="page_logo__7fc9l" href="/"><img alt="Polylayer" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Polylayer</span></a><nav class="page_nav__zpG_3"><a href="https://x.com/polylayerx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_iconLink__pODfJ" aria-label="Follow us on X"><img alt="X" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fxlogowhite.png&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fxlogowhite.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fxlogowhite.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/></a></nav></header><section class="page_hero__SKW6o"><div class="page_heroEyebrow__u_aZK">Multichain trading terminal</div><h1 class="page_heroTitle__Gfler">Prediction markets and perps.<br/><span class="page_heroAccent__Ur4Gt">One wallet. One terminal.</span></h1><p class="page_heroSub__YNSLe">Trade prediction markets and perpetual futures from a single Solana or EVM wallet, and earn yield on idle capital. Multichain by design, with specialized terminals, automation, paper trading, and risk tooling built in.</p><div class="page_heroCtas__PKEzw"><a class="page_ctaPrimary__wftVG" href="/markets">Enter App<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="page_ctaSecondary__bpX9v" href="/v1">Read the thesis</a></div></section><section class="page_partnersSection__V2FwW"><div class="page_partnersLabel__5LTCV">Built on + partnered with</div><div class="page_partners__J7RSa"><a href="https://polymarket.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Polymarket" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIconRound__GwnjA" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Polymarket</span></a><a href="https://hyperliquid.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Hyperliquid" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIcon__GxQl3" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Hyperliquid</span></a><a href="https://jup.ag" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Jupiter" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIcon__GxQl3" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Jupiter</span></a><a href="https://solana.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Solana" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIcon__GxQl3" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Solana</span></a><a href="https://polygon.technology" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Polygon" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIcon__GxQl3" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Polygon</span></a><a href="https://pyth.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="page_partner__AOWxV"><img alt="Pyth" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_partnerIcon__GxQl3" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpythlogonobg.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpythlogonobg.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpythlogonobg.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Pyth</span></a></div></section></div><section class="page_features__8wy9y"><div class="page_sectionHead__qnhAZ"><div class="page_sectionKicker__2G0U5">One terminal</div><h2 class="page_sectionTitle__hzsAh">Everything you trade, and everything you earn</h2><p class="page_sectionLede__fGFPV">Polylayer unifies prediction markets and perps behind one wallet, puts idle capital to work, and layers on the execution tooling pros expect.</p></div><div class="page_feature__CrGCB"><div class="page_featureText__0lch2"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#3b82f622"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wallet" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_featureTitle__kH4Xm">One wallet, every platform</h3><p class="page_featureBody__MYpMF">Connect a Solana or EVM wallet and reach Polymarket, Jupiter Perps, and Hyperliquid from one account. No bridging tabs, no signing across five different apps.</p><a class="page_featureLink__8qjk7" href="/markets">Connect a wallet <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="page_featureVisual__Abr78"><div class="page_walletMock__NI9wK"><div class="page_walletChip__x_LDv" style="background:#00c80518"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_chipIcon__4Ni6P" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fsolanalogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/>Solana</div><div class="page_walletChip__x_LDv" style="background:#3b82f618"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_chipIcon__4Ni6P" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolygonlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/>EVM</div><div class="page_walletArrow__uAG2F"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div><div class="page_walletTarget__6HYvf"><span class="page_walletDest__uGXws"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_walletDestRound__TydxF" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolymarketlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/>Polymarket</span><span class="page_walletDest__uGXws"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_walletDestIcon__lRI_r" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhyperliquidlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/>Hyperliquid</span><span class="page_walletDest__uGXws"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="page_walletDestIcon__lRI_r" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fjupiterlogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/>Jupiter</span></div></div></div></div><div class="page_feature__CrGCB page_reverse__Z3TrD"><div class="page_featureText__0lch2"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#ff950022"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff9500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-crosshair" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="22" x2="18" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="6" x2="2" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="6" y2="2"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="22" y2="18"></line></svg></div><h3 class="page_featureTitle__kH4Xm">The Advanced Orders Engine</h3><p class="page_featureBody__MYpMF">Take profit, stop loss, and OCO, with triggers far beyond last trade price. Fire a perp entry off a Polymarket probability, or compose triggers from whole networks of conditions. Everything runs server side, so it works with your terminal closed.</p><a class="page_featureLink__8qjk7" href="/strategies">Build an automation <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="page_featureVisual__Abr78"><div class="page_orderMock__fx4Ia"><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Take profit</span><span class="page_tagGreen__FrkmH">+18.0%</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Stop loss</span><span class="page_tagRed__SPspJ">−6.0%</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Stop trigger</span><span class="page_tagNeutral__rCu_L">VWAP</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>OCO</span><span class="page_tagNeutral__rCu_L">linked</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Trigger</span><span class="page_tagNeutral__rCu_L">Polymarket prob → perp</span></div></div></div></div><div class="page_feature__CrGCB"><div class="page_featureText__0lch2"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#a855f722"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 4 7l4 4"></path><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="m16 21 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M20 17H4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_featureTitle__kH4Xm">Perps, your way</h3><p class="page_featureBody__MYpMF">Pair trade across Jupiter and Hyperliquid: oil against Bitcoin, SOL against ETH, HYPE against BTC. Or go directional on BTC, ETH, and SOL with up to 180x leverage.</p><a class="page_featureLink__8qjk7" href="/hyperliquid">Trade perps <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="page_featureVisual__Abr78"><div class="page_playsMock__QDzvV"><div class="page_playsTitle__cgsi_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 4 7l4 4"></path><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="m16 21 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M20 17H4"></path></svg> Pair trade</div><div class="page_playsLeg__6rSlk"><span class="page_playsDot__FiO8P"></span>Long HYPE 5×</div><div class="page_playsLeg__6rSlk"><span class="page_playsDot__FiO8P"></span>Short BTC 5×</div><button class="page_playsExecute__z3Oc4" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg> Open pair · up to 180x</button></div></div></div></section><section class="page_yieldSection__T6uj9"><div class="page_yieldPanel__p4Gzi"><div class="page_yieldText__q440v"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#00c80522"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#00c805" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coins" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"></circle><path d="M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18"></path><path d="M7 6h1v4"></path><path d="m16.71 13.88.7.71-2.82 2.82"></path></svg></div><div class="page_yieldStat__26FlB"><span class="page_yieldStatValue__IQmqf">Up to 11%</span><span class="page_yieldStatUnit__YvF77">APY</span></div><h3 class="page_yieldTitle__TOuEi">Put idle capital to work</h3><p class="page_yieldBody__hGVGZ">Earn yield on the capital you are not trading through Jupiter Lend, Kamino, and HyperLend. Money that would sit still earns instead, and you move between trading and earning in one place.</p><a class="page_featureLink__8qjk7" href="/markets">Start earning <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div><div class="page_orderMock__fx4Ia"><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Jupiter Lend</span><span class="page_tagGreen__FrkmH">Earning</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Kamino</span><span class="page_tagGreen__FrkmH">Earning</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>HyperLend</span><span class="page_tagGreen__FrkmH">Earning</span></div><div class="page_orderRow__GTsC7"><span>Idle USDC</span><span class="page_tagNeutral__rCu_L">At work</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="page_terminalsSection__yzoVN"><div class="page_sectionHead__qnhAZ"><div class="page_sectionKicker__2G0U5">Specialized terminals</div><h2 class="page_sectionTitle__hzsAh">A screen built for every market type</h2><p class="page_sectionLede__fGFPV">Different markets trade differently. Polylayer ships a dedicated terminal for each, instead of forcing everything into one generic chart.</p></div><div class="page_terminalsGrid__tYhuj"><div class="page_terminalCard__WsBEn"><div class="page_terminalLabel__kTlvG"><span class="page_terminalDot__l_Z1x" style="background:#3b82f6"></span>Prediction Markets</div><p class="page_terminalBlurb__PquzW">Weather, stocks, commodities, and sports, each on a screen purpose built around how that market trades.</p><div class="page_terminalLinks___o8w3"><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Markets</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Sports</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Stocks</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Weather</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Commodities</span></div></div><div class="page_terminalCard__WsBEn"><div class="page_terminalLabel__kTlvG"><span class="page_terminalDot__l_Z1x" style="background:#00c805"></span>Crypto &amp; Perps</div><p class="page_terminalBlurb__PquzW">Directional crypto markets plus native Hyperliquid and Jupiter perps, with up to 180x leverage and pair trading.</p><div class="page_terminalLinks___o8w3"><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Up / Down</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Hit Price</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Hyperliquid Perps</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Jupiter Perps</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Pair Trade</span></div></div><div class="page_terminalCard__WsBEn"><div class="page_terminalLabel__kTlvG"><span class="page_terminalDot__l_Z1x" style="background:#a855f7"></span>Build Your Own</div><p class="page_terminalBlurb__PquzW">Design a terminal from a library of widgets with Polycanvas, then make it public and share it with the world.</p><div class="page_terminalLinks___o8w3"><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Polycanvas</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Widgets</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Custom layout</span><span class="page_terminalPill__n5ARF">Shareable</span></div></div></div></section><section class="page_toolsSection__Gr3rc"><div class="page_sectionHead__qnhAZ"><div class="page_sectionKicker__2G0U5">The rest of the stack</div><h2 class="page_sectionTitle__hzsAh">Tools that make every trade sharper</h2></div><div class="page_toolsGrid__DxPum"><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#14b8a622"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14b8a6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">Watchlists</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">Group markets into baskets, track them as one price, and one click buy or sell an entire theme. Public and shareable.</p></div><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#ff950022"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff9500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bell" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0"></path><path d="M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">Custom Alerts</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">Get notified on the exact market conditions you care about, delivered straight to Discord and Telegram.</p></div><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#3b82f622"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">Risk Engine</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">Import or build a portfolio, simulate resolutions and entries, and see projected PnL before you commit.</p></div><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#00c80522"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#00c805" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flask-conical" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2"></path><path d="M6.453 15h11.094"></path><path d="M8.5 2h7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">Paper Trading</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">The first paper trading for prediction markets and perps. Trade the full suite with zero risk, then share your profile.</p></div><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#a855f722"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">One-Click Plays</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">Group trades into reusable collections and execute the whole basket together when you are ready.</p></div><div class="page_toolCard__v_ZIn"><div class="page_badge__s34Is" style="background:#38bdf822"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19h8"></path><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="page_toolTitle__BeUS8">API &amp; CLI</h3><p class="page_toolBody__t_q6x">A rich trading API, agent friendly docs, and a CLI to build, automate, and run strategies in code.</p></div></div></section><section class="page_statsBand__jSLjy"><div class="page_statBlock__RcuP3"><div class="page_statValue__FXJDK">180x</div><div class="page_statLabel__YuhHa">max leverage
on Jupiter Perps</div></div><div class="page_statBlock__RcuP3"><div class="page_statValue__FXJDK">2</div><div class="page_statLabel__YuhHa">wallet types
Solana + EVM</div></div><div class="page_statBlock__RcuP3"><div class="page_statValue__FXJDK">12+</div><div class="page_statLabel__YuhHa">specialized
terminals</div></div></section><section class="page_finalCta__NPx4S"><div class="page_finalBadge__WezhA" style="background:#00c80522"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#00c805" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></div><h2 class="page_finalTitle__nngEX">Trade everything from one wallet</h2><p class="page_finalSub__vHqGd">Prediction markets, perps, yield, and every terminal in between. No capital? Start with paper trading. Connect Solana or EVM and start in seconds.</p><div class="page_heroCtas__PKEzw"><a class="page_ctaPrimary__wftVG" href="/markets">Enter App<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="page_ctaSecondary__bpX9v" href="/v1">Read the thesis</a></div></section><footer class="page_footer__sHKi3"><div class="page_footerTop__8Deu_"><div class="page_footerBrand__fYpqm"><div class="page_footerLogo__PfgLJ"><img alt="Polylayer" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fpolylayerlogotransparent.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/><span>Polylayer</span></div><p class="page_footerTagline__r1ko0">A multichain trading terminal for prediction markets and perps. Built for traders who demand control.</p><div class="page_footerMeta__DHs9D"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Non-custodial · Your keys, your trades</div></div><div class="page_footerCols__IgQCy"><div class="page_footerCol__gB8iB"><div class="page_footerColTitle__SRvVg">Product</div><a href="/markets">Markets</a><a href="/hyperliquid">Perps</a><a href="/canvas">Polycanvas</a><a href="/risk">Risk Engine</a></div><div class="page_footerCol__gB8iB"><div class="page_footerColTitle__SRvVg">Tools</div><a href="/watchlists">Watchlists</a><a href="/alerts">Custom Alerts</a><a href="/strategies">Automations</a></div><div class="page_footerCol__gB8iB"><div class="page_footerColTitle__SRvVg">Company</div><a href="/v1">Thesis</a><a href="https://x.com/polylayerx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X / Twitter</a></div></div></div><div class="page_footerWordmark__JYhsr">POLYLAYER</div><div class="page_footerBottom__cWZ_v"><span>© 2026 Polylayer</span><span>Trade everything from one wallet.</span></div></footer></div><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-e9294003587b8c5f.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><div hidden id="S:1"></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if("/$"===d||"/&"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else"$"!==d&&"$?"!==d&&"$~"!==d&&"$!"!==d&&"&"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data="$";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFr